from lesson_data import P,S,E,Q,finish
LESSON=finish(dict(number=7,prereqs=[4,6],lead=P("Follow recursive calls and traverse trees and graphs. Build a route finder and state exactly what makes its path shortest.","跟踪递归调用，遍历树与图，构建路径查询，并明确最短路径的衡量标准。"),before=P("Know stacks, queues and dictionary membership. A tuple groups values; None represents an empty subtree.","了解栈、队列与字典成员检查。元组组合值，None 表示空子树。"),outcomes=[P("Identify recursive base cases and progress.","识别递归基础情况与推进。"),P("Trace call stacks.","跟踪调用栈。"),P("Traverse binary trees.","遍历二叉树。"),P("Implement BFS with visited state.","用访问状态实现 BFS。"),P("Choose BFS or weighted shortest paths appropriately.","合理选择 BFS 或带权最短路径。")],sections=[
S("Recursion and the call stack","递归与调用栈","<p>A recursive function calls itself on a smaller subproblem. A base case returns without another call. For factorial, fact(0)=1 and fact(n)=n×fact(n−1) for nonnegative n. Each pending call keeps local state on the call stack; returning unwinds those frames. Show that a nonnegative measure decreases, otherwise a base case alone does not guarantee termination. Deep recursion also consumes stack memory; Python limits depth, so an iterative solution or explicit stack may be preferable for large inputs.</p>","<p>递归函数在更小子问题上调用自身，基础情况不再调用。非负阶乘满足 fact(0)=1、fact(n)=n×fact(n−1)。每个未完成调用在栈中保存局部状态，返回时逐层展开。需证明非负度量递减，仅有基础情况不保证终止。深递归消耗栈，Python 限制深度，大输入可用迭代或显式栈。</p>","Why is fact(n+1) instead of fact(n−1) a problem?","改为 fact(n+1) 有何问题？","The argument moves away from zero, so the base case is not reached.","参数远离零，无法达到基础情况。"),
S("Trees and traversals","树与遍历","<p>A rooted tree has a distinguished root and parent-child structure without cycles. A binary tree has at most two children per node. Preorder visits node, left, right; inorder visits left, node, right; postorder visits left, right, node. In a binary search tree, all left keys precede the node and right keys follow it, so inorder yields sorted keys. Height controls search cost: balanced trees have logarithmic height, while a chain can have linear height. The lab constructs immutable nested tuples rather than a full mutable search-tree implementation.</p>","<p>有根树有根及父子结构，无环。二叉树每节点最多两子节点。前序为节点、左、右，中序为左、节点、右，后序为左、右、节点。二叉搜索树左右键满足大小约束，所以中序有序。高度控制搜索成本：平衡树对数高度，链形树线性高度。实验用嵌套元组，而非完整可变搜索树。</p>","Does inorder sort every arbitrary binary tree?","中序能排序任意二叉树吗？","No, only trees satisfying the search-order property.","不能，需满足搜索树顺序性质。"),
S("Graphs and representation","图与表示","<p>A graph has vertices and edges. Edges may be directed, undirected or weighted. An adjacency list stores neighbours for each vertex, using O(V+E) storage in the usual model; an adjacency matrix uses O(V²) and supports direct edge checks. Unlike a tree, a graph can have cycles and multiple paths, so traversal needs visited state. Mark a vertex when scheduling it to avoid adding the same vertex repeatedly. Specify whether isolated vertices, unknown endpoints and parallel edges are allowed.</p>","<p>图由顶点和边组成，边可有向、无向或带权。邻接表通常 O(V+E) 存储，邻接矩阵 O(V²) 并支持直接查边。图可有环和多路径，遍历需访问状态。安排处理时就标记，避免重复入队。需规定孤立点、未知端点及平行边。</p>","Why mark visited on enqueue rather than only on removal?","为何入队时标记，而非只在出队时？","To prevent multiple predecessors from scheduling the same vertex.","防止多个前驱重复安排同一顶点。"),
S("DFS and BFS","深度与广度搜索","<p>Depth-first search follows a branch before alternatives, using recursion or an explicit stack. Breadth-first search uses a queue and explores vertices in nondecreasing edge distance from the start. With adjacency lists, both traverse reachable vertices and edges in O(V+E), assuming constant-time visited checks. BFS stores a predecessor when first discovering each vertex. Following predecessors backwards reconstructs a route. DFS finds a route but does not generally minimise its edge count.</p>","<p>DFS 先深入分支，用递归或显式栈。BFS 用队列，按到起点的边距离非递减访问。邻接表和常数访问检查下，两者 O(V+E)。BFS 首次发现节点时保存前驱，逆向追踪可恢复路线。DFS 可找路线，但通常不保证边数最少。</p>","Which frontier structure gives BFS its order?","哪种前沿结构保证 BFS 顺序？","A FIFO queue.","先进先出队列。"),
S("Weighted paths and limits","带权路径与限制","<p>BFS minimises edges only when each edge has the same cost. For nonnegative varying weights, Dijkstra repeatedly finalises the vertex with the smallest tentative distance and relaxes outgoing edges. A priority queue supports efficient selection. A direct edge of cost 100 loses to two edges costing 1 each, despite having fewer edges. Negative weights violate Dijkstra's finalisation argument; other algorithms are needed. State the objective before calling a route shortest, and distinguish unreachable from unknown vertices.</p>","<p>BFS 在等边成本时最小化边数。非负不同权重可用 Dijkstra，反复确定暂定距离最小节点并松弛出边，优先队列帮助选择。成本百的一条边输给两条成本一的边。负权破坏 Dijkstra 的确定论证，需要其他算法。称最短之前需说明目标，并区分不可达与未知顶点。</p>","Does BFS minimise travel time when road times vary?","道路时间不同时 BFS 最小化时间吗？","No, it minimises edge count, not varying total time.","不，它最小化边数而非不同权重总时间。")],
labs=[dict(file="m07_tree.py",title=P("Recursive trees","递归树"),intro=P("Draw the tree, predict traversal and height, then follow the base case for None.","画树、预测遍历与高度，跟踪 None 基础情况。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Implement preorder.</li><li>Make a three-node chain.</li><li>Explain why concatenating lists repeatedly adds copying cost.</li></ol>","<ol><li>实现前序。</li><li>构建三节点链。</li><li>解释反复拼接列表的复制成本。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Preorder is [value]+preorder(left)+preorder(right). A three-node chain has height 3. The returned-list implementation copies partial outputs repeatedly and can be quadratic on a skewed tree; an accumulator traversal appending each item once avoids that.</p>","<p>前序先 value，再左、右。三节点链高度三。返回列表版本反复复制部分结果，斜树上可二次；用累积列表每项追加一次可避免。</p>")),dict(file="m07_routes.py",title=P("A route finder","路线查询"),intro=P("The graph includes cycles and an isolated vertex. BFS records parents at discovery and returns None for an unreachable target.","图包含环与孤立点，BFS 发现时记录前驱，不可达返回 None。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Swap A's neighbour order.</li><li>Add E to D's neighbours in both directions.</li><li>Pass an unknown vertex and compare with unreachable E.</li></ol>","<ol><li>交换 A 邻居顺序。</li><li>加入 D 与 E 的双向边。</li><li>查询未知点，对比不可达 E。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>The alternate equally short route is A,C,D. Connecting E gives A,B,D,E. Unknown vertices raise KeyError; valid but disconnected vertices return None. Ties depend on neighbour order, not on a different distance.</p>","<p>另一等长路线为 A,C,D。连接 E 后为 A,B,D,E。未知点抛 KeyError，有效但断开的点返回 None。邻居顺序影响平局，不改变距离。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"Base case","基础情况","Give the base case for counting nodes in an empty tree.","空树节点计数基础情况？","<p>Return 0 for None; otherwise 1+count(left)+count(right).</p>","<p>None 返回零，否则一加左右计数。</p>"),E(1,"Traversal","遍历","For root B with children A,C, give inorder and preorder.","根 B，子 A、C，给中序与前序。","<p>Inorder A,B,C; preorder B,A,C.</p>","<p>中序 A,B,C，前序 B,A,C。</p>"),E(2,"Cycle","环","Why can DFS loop forever on A→B→A without visited state?","无访问状态时 DFS 为何在 A→B→A 循环？","<p>Each recursive step revisits the other vertex, with no decreasing unvisited set or exit. Mark visits before exploring neighbours.</p>","<p>不断重访，无递减未访问集合。探索邻居前标记。</p>"),E(2,"Storage","存储","Which representation is smaller for a sparse graph?","稀疏图哪种表示更小？","<p>An adjacency list, O(V+E), rather than an O(V²) matrix when E is much smaller than V².</p>","<p>E 远小于 V² 时，O(V+E) 邻接表更小。</p>"),E(2,"Weighted counterexample","带权反例","A→C costs 10; A→B→C costs 2+2. Which does BFS favour?","直达成本十，经过 B 成本四，BFS 偏好哪个？","<p>Direct A→C has one edge; it is not minimum cost. Weighted shortest path should select total cost 4.</p>","<p>直达一条边，却非最低成本。带权最短应选四。</p>"),E(3,"BFS proof","BFS 证明","Why is a first-discovered BFS path shortest in edges?","BFS 首次发现路线为何边数最少？","<p>The queue processes all vertices at distance d before d+1. New neighbours get distance d+1; any shorter predecessor would already have been processed, so a shorter discovery cannot arrive later.</p>","<p>队列先处理距离 d 再 d+1，新邻居距离 d+1。更短前驱应早已处理，故不会后来才出现更短发现。</p>"),E(3,"Stack space","栈空间","Compare recursive traversal stack depth in balanced and chain trees.","比较平衡树与链树递归栈深。","<p>Depth equals height: O(log n) for a balanced tree, O(n) for a chain. Both still visit n nodes.</p>","<p>深度等于高度：平衡 O(log n)，链 O(n)，都访问 n 节点。</p>"),E(2,"Path reconstruction","路径恢复","Why reverse the accumulated parent path?","为何反转累积前驱路径？","<p>Following parents starts at goal and ends at start; reversing gives the requested start-to-goal order.</p>","<p>沿前驱从终点到起点，反转才是起点至终点。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("Recursion needs?","递归需要什么？","Base case and progress","基础情况与推进","Only self-calls","仅自调用","No memory","无需内存","Progress makes the base reachable.","推进让基础可达。"),Q("BFS uses?","BFS 用什么？","Queue","队列","Stack only","仅栈","Sorted array always","总用有序数组","FIFO expands layers.","FIFO 扩展层。"),Q("BFS minimises?","BFS 最小化什么？","Number of edges","边数","Arbitrary edge costs","任意边成本","Memory always","总是内存","Equal-cost edges make edge distance meaningful.","等成本边使边距离有意义。"),Q("Dijkstra requires?","Dijkstra 要求什么？","Nonnegative weights","非负权","Negative cycles","负环","No graph","无需图","Negative weights break finalisation.","负权破坏确定论证。"),Q("A graph traversal needs visited state because?","图遍历为何需访问状态？","Cycles and shared paths","环与共享路径","Titles are strings","书名是字符串","All edges are sorted","所有边有序","It prevents repeated scheduling.","防止重复安排。"),Q("Inorder yields sorted keys when?","中序何时产生排序键？","The tree satisfies BST order","树满足搜索树顺序","Every tree","任意树","Only empty trees","仅空树","The left/right key invariant is necessary.","左右键不变式必要。")],pitfalls=[P("The returned-list tree lab is illustrative; repeated concatenation is not an optimal traversal.","返回列表的树实验用于教学，反复拼接不是最优遍历。"),P("A shortest route must specify its cost model.","最短路线必须规定成本模型。")],reading=[(P("MIT algorithm lectures","MIT 算法讲义"),"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-006-introduction-to-algorithms-spring-2020/",P("Read graph search and shortest paths; distinguish the objectives.","阅读图搜索与最短路径，区分目标。"))],terms=[(P("Frontier","前沿"),P("Discovered vertices awaiting processing.","已发现但待处理顶点。")),(P("Relaxation","松弛"),P("Improving a tentative distance via an edge.","通过边改善暂定距离。")),(P("Height","高度"),P("Here, the maximum number of nodes on a root-to-leaf path.","此处为根至叶路径最大节点数。"))],review=P("<p>Trace parents for an unreachable and a tied shortest path. Explain the recursive empty case. Module 08 compares design strategies beyond traversal.</p>","<p>跟踪不可达与等长路径的前驱，解释递归空情况。模块 08 将比较更广泛设计策略。</p>")))
